            Raccoon dog <s>mess of a person</s>. <br /> Have I forgot to say that
            I like raccoon dogs? <br /> Trying to LARP as a tech bro making iPhone
            apps.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="socialsList">
        <a href="mailto:pat@parpok.xyz">Mail</a>
        <a href="https://101010.pl/@parpok">Fedi</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/parpok">Messy code GH</a>
    </div>

    <div class="bagesList">
        <!-- <div class="peoplesBages"> -->
        <a href="./"
            ><Image
                src="/badges/ppl/me.png"
                alt="My badge"
                width="88"
                height="31"
            /></a
        >
        <a href="https://memersoda.xyz"
            ><Image
                src="/badges/ppl/memersoda.png"
                alt="Memersoda badge"
                width="88"
                height="31"
            /></a
        >
        <a href="https://smeagol.neocities.org"
